{"id": "r04_01", "text": "The left bin gets the blue objects, the center bin takes the red ones, and the right bin receives everything yellow.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_bin_first_verbs", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_02", "text": "Chuck the reds in the right one, the yellows in the middle and the blues on the left, cheers.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_informal", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_03", "text": "Please sort by colour: yellow pieces go in the leftmost bin, blue pieces in the centre bin, red pieces in the rightmost bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_british", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_04", "text": "First put all the blue items into the right bin, then the yellow items into the left bin, and finally the red items into the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_sequence", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_05", "text": "Red and blue both go to the center bin; yellow goes to the left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_shared_bin", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_06", "text": "Everything goes into the center bin except the red objects, which go into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_except", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_07", "text": "Could you kindly place the red items in the middle container, the yellow ones in the right container and the blue ones in the left container? Thank you.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_polite", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_08", "text": "The center bin is reserved for yellow. Blue belongs on the left, and red on the right.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_reserved", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_09", "text": "Put every object in the left bin, whatever its colour.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_all_one_bin", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_10", "text": "Sortt the objcets: red into the center, blue into the left, yellow into the right.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_typo_other_words", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_11", "text": "Yellow objects: center. Red objects: center. Blue objects: right.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_terse", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_12", "text": "The left bin holds the red objects and the yellow objects, and the right bin holds the blue objects.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_bin_first_shared", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_13", "text": "Group the colours as follows: the blue things in the middle bin, the red things in the right-hand bin, the yellow things in the left-hand bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_hand_synonyms", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_14", "text": "I'd like the yellow ones on the far right, the red ones on the far left and the blue ones in between.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_between", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_15", "text": "Sort red into the right bin and both of the other colours into the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_other_colours", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_16", "text": "Every red object should end up in the center bin, every blue object in the center bin too, and every yellow object in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_shared_bin", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_17", "text": "Put the yellow objects into the center bin and the red and blue objects into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_shared_bin", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_18", "text": "Pop the yellow bits in the centre bin, the red bits in the right-hand one and the blue bits in the left-hand one.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_british_informal", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_19", "text": "Each colour gets its own bin: red in the middle, blue on the right, yellow on the left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_own_bin", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_20", "text": "Blue in the left bin, red in the left bin, yellow in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_terse_shared", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_21", "text": "Move the red objects to the bin in the middle, and the yellow and blue objects to the leftmost bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_shared_bin", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_22", "text": "The right bin collects the red objects and the yellow objects; the left bin collects the blue objects.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colour_bin_first_verbs", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_23", "text": "Take each blue object and drop it in the center bin. Yellow ones go right. Red ones go left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_multi_sentence", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_24", "text": "Sort everything into the middle bin, please.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_all_one_bin", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_25", "text": "Yellow goes right, and so does blue. Red goes center.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_so_does", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_26", "text": "Hey robot, red objects into the right bin please, blue objects into the center bin, yellow objects into the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_casual", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_27", "text": "Use the left bin for the yellow objects and the right bin for everything else.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_everything_else", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_28", "text": "The yellow items and the red items share the left bin, while the blue items go in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_share", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_29", "text": "Into the left bin go the red objects; into the right bin, the yellow objects; into the center bin, the blue objects.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_inverted", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_30", "text": "Don't put the blue objects in the center bin; they belong in the right one. Red goes to the left bin and yellow goes to the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "colour_negation_correction", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_31", "text": "Put all cubes in the left bin, all cylinders in the center bin and all triangles in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_32", "text": "Sort by shape this time, not by colour: cylinders to the right, cubes to the left, triangular prisms to the middle.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_33", "text": "Red objects go in the left bin and yellow objects in the center bin. Blue cubes and blue cylinders go in the right bin, but blue triangles go in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape_colour_exception", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_34", "text": "Cylinders take priority: every cylinder goes in the right bin. Apart from cylinders, red goes left and yellow and blue go center.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape_priority", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_35", "text": "The shape rule wins over the colour rule: triangles always go in the left bin. Otherwise, red to the right, yellow to the right, blue to the center.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shape_priority", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_36", "text": "Put the yellow cube in the left bin and every other object in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape_single_type", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_37", "text": "Blue goes in the center bin, except blue cylinders, which go in the left bin. Red and yellow go in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape_colour_exception", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_38", "text": "Cubes in the middle; everything else sorted by colour, red left, yellow right, blue right.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape_then_colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_39", "text": "Shapes only: the prisms go in the right bin, the cylinders in the left bin and the cubes in the right bin too.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shape_only_shared", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_40", "text": "Yellow triangles and red cylinders go to the left bin. All remaining objects go to the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape_specific_rest", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_41", "text": "Pile every cylinder into the center bin and every cube and triangle into the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shape_only_shared", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_42", "text": "Red pieces go to the right bin, unless they are cubes; red cubes go to the left bin. Yellow pieces go left, blue pieces go center.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "shape_colour_exception", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_43", "text": "Put only the red objects in the right bin; leave the yellow and blue ones where they are.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_44", "text": "Yellow into the left bin, blue into the center bin. Red stays on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "counter_explicit", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_45", "text": "Sort the blue objects into the right bin and the red objects into the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "counter_uncovered", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_46", "text": "Leave all the cylinders on the counter, and put every other object in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "counter_shape", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_47", "text": "Please move the yellow items to the right bin. Don't touch anything else.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter_dont_touch", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_48", "text": "Red to the middle, blue to the right, and the yellow triangle should stay on the table; other yellow objects go to the left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "counter_shape_colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_49", "text": "Only cubes need sorting today: red cubes in the left bin, yellow cubes in the center bin, blue cubes in the right bin. Leave the other shapes alone.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter_cubes_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_50", "text": "Put all the red and yellow objects into the left bin. The blue objects should not be moved.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "counter_not_moved", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r04_51", "text": "Hi team, quick note before the run: the red emergency stop is on the left side of the cell, and the blue cable tray runs along the right wall, so mind your step. The robot instruction is: yellow objects go to the right bin, red objects to the center bin, blue objects to the left bin. Thanks!", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_embedded_distractors", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r04_52", "text": "Yellow objects go in the left bin (not the right!), red objects in the right bin (not the center!), and blue objects in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_parenthetical_not", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r04_53", "text": "Start by putting every object in the left bin. After that, take the blue ones back out and put them in the right bin instead.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_sequential_state", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r04_54", "text": "Blue and red objects go to the center and left bins respectively; yellow goes into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_respectively", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r04_55", "text": "Blue objects go in the left bin and red objects in the center bin; yellow objects go in whichever bin is left over.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_left_over", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r04_56", "text": "Cylinders go in the left bin, except red ones. All red objects, red cylinders included, go in the right bin. Any yellow or blue object that is not a cylinder goes in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_colour_beats_shape", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r04_57", "text": "Ignore the old sticky note that says 'red to the left bin, blue to the right bin'. The new instruction: red to the right bin, blue to the center bin, yellow to the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "adv_quoted_revoked", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r04_58", "text": "Red goes in the bin that is neither on the left nor on the right. Blue goes in the left one and yellow in the right one.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_neither_nor_bin", "adversarial": true}
